Z||000001||Archie||11-07-2000||10:28 PM||||As you know, I just had a phone conversation with your mechanic. He probally has updated you that there is not a problem with the adapter plate or any other part of my 15 year old design. Maybe he told you that IMHO, based on the information we have so far, the problem appears to be incorrect installation of the axle shaft assembly.<P>It will be interesting to see what his results are after our conversation.<P>Archie||||reg||1
