Z||000005||Richard Parnell||11-08-2000||03:14 PM||||It looks like the problem may have been found.  Upon separating the tranny from the engine we found that the throwout bearing was binding on the shaft.  Probably from being joined at an angle.  Made sure that shaft was smooth and bearing was working smoothly.  Shifts smothly with little play.  Will be taken out on test drive in a couple of hours.  Finally!!!  Just hope the friggin wheels don't fall off on the first corner we go around.||||reg||6
Z||000006||batboy||11-08-2000||08:39 PM||||Just don't go around any corners for a couple days  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
